/www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/524804/5248040313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_541_AUROPHARMA_2012_2013_16072013115607.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Aurobindo Pharma reported its highest ever quarterly revenue of 10,263 crores for Q2 FY27, representing a 24% year-on-year growth, driven by core markets and successful strategic integration. Operating EBITDA reached 2,156 crores with a margin of 21%, while the company closed the quarter with a net cash position of USD 189 million. Management reiterated its FY27 guidance of double-digit revenue growth, EBITDA margins north of 21%, and absolute EBITDA in excess of 8,000 crores. Furthermore, the company completed the acquisitions of Lannett and A1 Biochem during the period to strengthen its US presence and small molecule CRDMO capabilities. Aurobindo Pharma reported its Q2FY27 financial and business highlights, achieving a highest-ever quarterly revenue of INR 10,263 crores and record EBITDA of INR 2,156 crores.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company reiterates its FY guidance with double-digit revenue growth, EBITDA margins north of 21%, and absolute EBITDA in excess of 8,000 crore.","quote":"We reiterate our FY guidance with the double-digit revenue growth, EBITDA margins north of 21% and absolute EBITDA in excess of 8,000 crore, with a potential upside from positive outperformance in our high-value strategic business areas.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management remains fully confident in expanding EBITDA margin to upwards of 22% in the coming years.","quote":"We remain fully confident in our ability to further expand our EBITDA margin to upwards of 22% in the coming years [FY28], supported by resilience of our core business and increasing contribution from strategic growth drivers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reiterated the FY27 guidance for double-digit revenue growth, EBITDA margins above 21%, and absolute EBITDA exceeding 8000.","quote":"We continue to reiterate our FY27 guidance to double-digit revenue growth, with EBITDA margins north of 21% and absolute EBITDA in excess of 8000, with potential upside driven by positive outperformance in our high-value strategic business areas.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Europe has consistently delivered promised results with a strong and robust Q2 performance.","quote":"Europe has been consistently delivering the promised results, and Q2 has been a very strong and robust one for us, despite the holiday month of August coming in between.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management anticipates that the robust growth in Europe will be sustained in upcoming quarters.","quote":"And what we anticipate in the upcoming quarters is, this growth will be sustained.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that European growth markets maintained strong momentum and the U.S. business sustained growth.","quote":"European growth market maintained strong momentum and our U.S. business contained a sustained growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Total capital expenditure for the quarter stood at 89 million.","quote":"Total capital expenditure stood at 89 million, of which 47 million towards the development capabilities and 42 million towards strategic priorities respectively, thereby supporting our future growth plan.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Net capex for the quarter was US$ 89 million primarily toward capability enhancements and new business developments.","quote":"Net Capex of US$ 89 million* primarily towards capability enhancements, new business developments","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=dd473eb4-9278-410e-9166-daa5e671f689.pdf"},{"claim":"Net CapEx for the quarter stood at $78 million and remained focused mainly towards TheraNym Biologics.","quote":"Net CapEx for the quarter stood at $78 million. Capital expenditure remained focused mainly towards TheraNym Biologics.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Operating EBITDA for the quarter was 2,156 crores, growing at 28% year-on-year with a margin of 21%.","quote":"Operating EBITDA was 2,156 crores, growing at 28% year-on-year with a margin of 21%, despite increase in input cost and freight rate.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross margin for the quarter was 61.2% compared to 59.7% in the corresponding period last year.","quote":"Gross margin for the quarter was 61.2% compared to 59.7% in the corresponding period last year, while contribution stood at 6,280 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"The company sustained strong profitability with the highest-ever quarterly EBITDA of INR 2,156 Cr at a margin of 21.0%.","quote":"Sustained strong profitability with the highest-ever quarterly EBITDA of ₹2,156 Cr at a margin of 21.0%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=dd473eb4-9278-410e-9166-daa5e671f689.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross margin for Q2FY27 was 61.2% compared to 59.7% in Q2FY26.","quote":"Gross Margin 61.2% 59.7% 149 bps","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=dd473eb4-9278-410e-9166-daa5e671f689.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross margin remained resilient at 60.4% compared to 58.8% in Q1 FY26, supported by an improved business mix and operating efficiency.","quote":"Gross margin remained resilient at 60.4% compared to 58.8% of Q1 FY26, benefiting from an improved business mix and operating efficiency.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The Pen-G facility has the capability to ramp up production to 15,000 tons.","quote":"So, we have the capability to ramp to produce 15,000 tons.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Production at the China OSD facility doubled over the past 12 months.","quote":"Further production at our China OSD facility doubled over past 12 months, making a significant milestone in the ramp-up of one of our strategic investments for sustained growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company generated a strong cash flow of USD 146 million during the quarter and closed with a net cash position of USD 189 million.","quote":"We have generated a very strong cash flow of USD 146 million during the quarter after funding strategic investments and capital allocation initiatives, and closed with a net cash position of USD 189 million.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"The company generated a net cash flow of US$ 146mn during the quarter.","quote":"Generated net cash flow of US$ 146mn during the quarter, with a strong net cash position (including investments) of ~US$ 189 million* as on 30-Sep-26","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=dd473eb4-9278-410e-9166-daa5e671f689.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintained a strong net cash position of $42 million after payments towards buyback and the Lannett acquisition.","quote":"Our balance sheet continues to remain strong with a strong net cash position of $42 million after payment of $85 million towards buyback and $247 million for Lannett acquisition, reinforcing our strong financial resilience and focus on various accretive growth opportunities while maintaining a disciplined capital structure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"There was an increase in raw material procurement cost due to the Gulf issue.","quote":"So, we had an increase in the raw material procurement cost due to the Gulf issue, but still the overall impact of the cost has not gone into the consumption.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated operating EBITDA explored a one-time impact of Rs. 43 crores towards a loss on derecognition of leased residuals.","quote":"Operating EBITDA, exploring one-time impact of Rs. 43 crores towards a loss on derecognition of leased residuals, stood at Rs. 1,924 crores with a margin of 21%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=649d2e0e-7f23-4dce-8d2c-623d34bce215.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects to achieve breakeven for the China facility during the current quarter.","quote":"We’ll be achieving the breakeven this quarter, Damayanti.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf","timeframe":"this quarter"},{"claim":"Management expects FY28 to be far better than FY27 due to various initiatives and the full year benefit of Lannett.","quote":"I think we can say, FY28 should be far better than FY27 because of the various initiatives and full year benefit of Lannett.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86424134-1eaa-4a3a-8d33-bfadb65d86e5.pdf","timeframe":"FY28"},{"clai